<Base title="About — Anvi Innovate">
  <span class="pill">About</span>
  <h1>The skilled human layer behind AI</h1>
  <div style="max-width:760px;">
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:1.1rem;">
      Anvi Innovate is a resource-centric AI/ML talent company. We train people in modern AI and Generative AI foundations,
      validate their skills through a rigorous assessment, and deploy them to teams building real AI products.
    </p>
    <h2>The model</h2>
    <p class="muted">Clients submit demand; we supply assessed, ready resources on a commission-on-output basis. Candidates apply, prove their foundations, train, and get deployed — a clear path from skill to income.</p>
    <h2>The market gap</h2>
    <p class="muted">The global AI training dataset market is projected to reach <strong>USD 8.60 billion by 2030</strong> at a <strong>21.9% CAGR</strong> (Grand View Research). The bottleneck isn't compute — it's skilled, reliable people. That's what we build.</p>
    <p class="muted">In collaboration with <strong>bxup.in</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
